          "description": "Performs the epoch-boundary update of the proposer_lookahead vector. Computes last_epoch_start as len(proposer_lookahead) - SLOTS_PER_EPOCH, then shifts proposer_lookahead[:last_epoch_start] = proposer_lookahead[SLOTS_PER_EPOCH:] to remove the expired epoch. Then computes new proposer indices for epoch (current_epoch + MIN_SEED_LOOKAHEAD + 1) and writes them into proposer_lookahead[last_epoch_start:].",
