        {
          "id": "INV-018",
          "text": "The proposer schedule for epoch N MUST be determined entirely by the RANDAO seed from epoch N - MIN_SEED_LOOKAHEAD - 1 and the effective balances at the start of epoch N - MIN_SEED_LOOKAHEAD."
