          "id": "INV-019",
          "text": "No action taken by a validator after the start of epoch N - MIN_SEED_LOOKAHEAD can alter the proposer schedule for epoch N."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-020",
          "text": "The RANDAO delay and the effective-balance delay for proposer election are aligned, both being MIN_SEED_LOOKAHEAD epochs."
