      "description": "The proposer_lookahead field being stored in the BeaconState makes the next-epoch proposer schedule accessible to the EVM application layer via the beacon state root and a simple Merkle proof. This highly simplifies the implementation of on-chain components for based preconfirmation protocols, which previously required off-chain oracles or complex attestation mechanisms.",
