      "name": "SSLE Forward Compatibility",
      "description": "The proposer_lookahead field is designed to be forward-compatible with future Single Secret Leader Election (SSLE) mechanisms. Current SSLE designs still rely on a lookahead, albeit an encrypted one. The field type could be changed to store encrypted validator indices (e.g. List[EncryptedValidatorIndex]). If a future construction removes lookahead entirely, the field can be set to an empty list.",
