      "design_rationale": "Current SSLE designs still rely on a lookahead, albeit encrypted. The proposer_lookahead field can be reused by changing its type to List[EncryptedValidatorIndex]. If a construction removes lookahead entirely, the field can be set to an empty list. APS (Attester Proposer Separation) envisions more sophisticated (i.e., more DDoS-resistant) execution proposers, reducing the need for SSLE."
